### Listar quartos
GET http://localhost:7070/rooms

### Criar reserva STANDARD
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "guestName": "João Silva",
  "guestEmail": "joao@example.com",
  "guestCpf": "12345678901",
  "checkIn": "2027-03-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-03-12",
  "guests": 2,
  "ratePlan": "STANDARD"
}

### Criar reserva NON_REFUNDABLE
POST http://localhost:7070/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
